GAL16V8
Gates

NC   A    B    C    D    NC   NC   NC   NC   GND
NC   AND  OR   XOR  NAND NOTA AND4 MAJ  PASS VCC

AND  = A * B
OR   = A + B
XOR  = A * /B + /A * B
NAND = /A + /B
NOTA = /A
AND4 = A * B * C * D
MAJ  = A * B + A * C + B * C
PASS = A

DESCRIPTION

Bench test for MiniGecko (MINIGECKO-011): eight combinational outputs from
four inputs, each a gate you can check with switches on A-D and a meter or
LEDs on pins 12-19. Decompiled equations should read back as written here.
